sequenceDiagram
    participant B as Buyer
    participant D as Seller Daemon
    participant N as BSV Network

    Note over B,D: Phase 1 — Method 42 Handshake
    B->>D: POST /handshake {P_buyer, nonce_b}
    D->>D: session_key = SHA256(ECDH.x || nonce_b || nonce_s)
    D->>B: {P_seller, nonce_s, HMAC verify}
    B->>B: Verify HMAC, session established

    Note over B,D: Phase 2 — Price Discovery
    B->>D: GET /buy/{txid}?buyer_pubkey=P_buyer
    D->>B: {price, capsule_hash}

    Note over B,N: Phase 3 — HTLC Construction
    B->>B: Build HTLC script
    Note right of B: OP_IF SHA256 capsule_hash EQUALVERIFY seller CHECKSIG\nOP_ELSE timeout CSV buyer CHECKSIG OP_ENDIF
    B->>N: Broadcast HTLC tx

    Note over B,D: Phase 4 — Atomic Swap
    B->>D: POST /buy/{txid} {buyer_pubkey, htlc_tx}
    D->>D: capsule = aes_key XOR buyer_mask
    D->>B: {capsule}
    D->>N: Claim HTLC (reveal preimage)
    B->>B: Verify SHA256(capsule) == capsule_hash
    B->>B: aes_key = capsule XOR buyer_mask

    Note over B,D: Phase 5 — Content Download
    B->>D: GET /_bitfs/data/{hash}
    D->>B: encrypted ciphertext
    B->>B: Decrypt with AES-256-GCM
